    <title>修复algolia</title>
    <link href="https://yexingshusheng.com/2026/09/xiu-fu-algolia.html"/>
    <id>https://yexingshusheng.com/2026/09/xiu-fu-algolia.html</id>
    <published>2026-09-01T14:26:30.000Z</published>
    <updated>2026-09-02T14:45:41.367Z</updated>
    
    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>今天收到 algolia 的邮件…</p><span id="more"></span><p>不用想，应该是太久没使用搜索功能，项目暂停了。</p><p>记得第一次暂停时，我还发邮件给官方，然后给我恢复了。</p><p>今天修复一下，需要修改一些配置文件：</p><p>1、<code>~/.zshrc</code>中的<code>Admin API Key</code>；</p><p>2、博客配置文件中的 algolia 部分：</p><p>重新创建 Application 和 Index，找到 Application ID、Search-Only API Key、Admin API Key。</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">applicationID: <span class="string">&#x27;Your Algolia Application ID&#x27;</span></span><br><span class="line">apiKey: <span class="string">&#x27;A Search-Only API key&#x27;</span></span><br><span class="line">indexName: <span class="string">&#x27;The name of the Algolia index to use&#x27;</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>]]></content>
    
    
    <summary type="html">&lt;p&gt;今天收到 algolia 的邮件…&lt;/p&gt;</summary>
    
    
    
